plan_steps[6]{id,order,title,status,created_at,updated_at,evidence,completed_at}:
  plan-step-001,1,Confirm tagged Core subscription schemas and live instance behavior,completed,"2026-07-31T20:22:04.252Z","2026-07-31T20:31:45.685Z","Official REST/WebSocket/auth docs refreshed; tagged Core 2026.7.4 commands.py, messages.py, core.py, entityfilter.py, and upstream tests inspected. Live instance reports 2026.7.4 and returned schema-only trigger/condition catalogs plus a redacted compact entity snapshot.","2026-07-31T20:31:45.685Z"
  plan-step-002,2,Implement generic bounded subscription collection and normalized entity deltas,completed,"2026-07-31T20:22:04.252Z","2026-07-31T20:31:47.715Z","Added reusable bounded collection with early max-event termination and unsubscribe cleanup, subscribe_entities server filters, expanded initial rows, and lossless add/change/remove patches. Focused transport/command tests and live built CLI pass.","2026-07-31T20:31:47.715Z"
  plan-step-003,3,Add typed automation platform discovery commands,completed,"2026-07-31T20:22:04.252Z","2026-07-31T20:31:49.377Z","Added trigger/condition/all platform catalog subscriptions with deterministic event merging, bounded loading window, detailed help, agent planning integration, focused tests, and live built CLI proof.","2026-07-31T20:31:49.377Z"
  plan-step-004,4,"Complete exact coverage, strict quality, docs, setup wizard, formats, and live acceptance",completed,"2026-07-31T20:22:04.252Z","2026-07-31T20:37:44.845Z","Exact 100/100/100/100 source coverage (116 files, 1294 tests); 100% docstrings (123/123 files); typecheck, ESLint, duplication threshold, <=300 code-line gate, ShellCheck, Bun audit, Trivy, build, exhaustive compiled help, setup/settings coverage, six-format live E2E, entity deltas, and trigger/condition catalogs all passed. No private payloads persisted.","2026-07-31T20:37:44.845Z"
  plan-step-005,5,Generate PM changelog and prove release dry-run,completed,"2026-07-31T20:22:04.252Z","2026-07-31T20:44:14.705Z",Latest pm-cli 2026.7.31 and pm-changelog 2026.7.29-1 installed and pinned; generated CHANGELOG is deterministic; strict PM validation and health are clean after runtime cache clear; graph audit has zero findings across 67 nodes and 223 edges; clean-worktree auto-release dry-run reached terminal success with full release verification and isolated npx plus bunx package smoke tests without publishing.,"2026-07-31T20:44:14.705Z"
  plan-step-006,6,"Publish PR, await exact-head checks and bot reviews, address every actionable finding, and merge",completed,"2026-07-31T20:22:04.252Z","2026-07-31T21:05:28.664Z","PR 80 reviewed exact head 5c6ebb04186d7c02c7f94c2bbb8f942dfa3ea544 and merged to master as 8a0c573248c039bc4732c4f2f6ed1dac40752023. Every hosted check passed; all five CodeRabbit threads were reacted to, answered, and resolved; CodeRabbit confirmed dispositions; Gemini reported service sunset, Sourcery quota exhaustion, and Greptile did not acknowledge either invocation within the full review window. No actionable findings remain.","2026-07-31T21:05:28.664Z"
body: Keep transport generic enough for current subscription events while expose typed bounded commands. Validate only read-only live operations. Repair the current release blocker through audited PM history normalization and exact clean-runner parity.
